WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.500
In the Shortcuts library, open Kotori.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Touch and hold Record Entry with the microphone icon.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Choose New Shortcut to create a personal shortcut.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Tap Edit to open the action editor.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.500
Tap Entry and choose Ask Each Time.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Open the name menu at the top and choose Rename.

7
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Choose a short name, such as Log my spending.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.733
Check the saved name. This video covers setting up the name.
